+Feature: Filter routing
+  As a user viewing a subset of todos
+  I want the URL hash to control which todos are visible
+  So that I can switch between All, Active, and Completed views
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded with no existing todos
+
+  @captain
+  Scenario: Hash change to active filter hides completed todos
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    And the user has added a todo "Walk dog"
+    And the user toggles the first todo
+    When the user navigates to "#/active"
+    Then the todo list shows 1 todo
+    And the remaining todo is "Walk dog"
+
+  @captain
+  Scenario: Hash change to completed filter shows only completed todos
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    And the user has added a todo "Walk dog"
+    And the user toggles the first todo
+    When the user navigates to "#/completed"
+    Then the todo list shows 1 todo
+    And the remaining todo is "Buy milk"
+
+  @captain
+  Scenario: Hash change to all filter shows all todos
+    Given the user has added a todo "Buy milk"
+    And the user has added a todo "Walk dog"
+    And the user toggles the first todo
+    When the user navigates to "#/"
+    Then the todo list shows 2 todos
