+    Given the file "watchbill.json" is read
+    Then every top-level key matches the pattern "watch{int}"
+    And each watch contains a "scenarios" array
+    And each scenario reference matches the repo-root-relative "feature" pattern
+
+  @conformance
+  Scenario: Perturbation quiescence
+    Given the implementation directories are scanned for "PERTURBATION"
+    Then no standing "PERTURBATION" token exists in committed production code
